.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.PP
.nf
A writer that passes the document tree on unchanged (e\&.g\&. a
serializer\&.)

Documents written by UnfilteredWriters are typically reused at a
later date using a subclass of `readers\&.ReReader`\&.

.fi
